(()=>{const I="assets/ck6-ta/",O=(...Q)=>Q.reduce((Y,F)=>Y.flatMap(q=>[].concat(F).map(U=>q+U)),[""]),e=(...Q)=>{const Y=[...new Set(Q.flatMap(F=>O(...F)))];return{type:"type",ans:Y[0],alts:Y.slice(1)}},u=[{k:"A",t:"True (T)"},{k:"B",t:"False (F)"}],S=[{k:"A",t:"Right (R)"},{k:"B",t:"Wrong (W)"}],B="<b>PART 1.</b> My name is Pablo. I'm eleven years old and I live in the capital of Colombia. I've got one brother. My brother is fourteen and he goes to the same school as me. I get up at 6 o'clock in the morning. I don't eat breakfast because I haven't got time. I just drink a glass of milk. I leave my house at 6:30 because school starts at 7:30. We study in the morning and break time is at 9:30. I often eat a sandwich at break time. School finishes at 11:30, so I come home and have lunch at 1 p.m. We often have soup with corn bread and fish or meat. We have mango juice, too – my favourite. Sometimes my mum makes <i>paisa</i> for dinner. <i>Paisa</i> is a special dish with rice, beef, beans and sausages. It's very tasty.",c="<b>PART 2.</b><br><b>Mr Green:</b> Hey, Tom. How's your first week at the new school.<br><b>Tom:</b> Well, it's great. But I was a bit nervous at first.<br><b>Mr Green:</b> Why were you nervous?<br><b>Tom:</b> The teachers are all new to me, most of my classmates are new too.<br><b>Mr Green:</b> Are they friendly to you?<br><b>Tom:</b> Ah, yeah. They are all nice to me.<br><b>Mr Green:</b> What subjects did you have today?<br><b>Tom:</b> Well, we had maths, geography and computer studies, my favourite subject.<br><b>Mr Green:</b> Oh, good. So everything is going well at school?<br><b>Tom:</b> Right. I had a good first day. And ... Dad, can I join the judo club at school? I like to do judo.<br><b>Mr Green:</b> Yeah, OK, if you like. But don't forget to do your homework.<br><b>Tom:</b> I won't. Thanks, Dad.",A="There are four people in Minh's family, his parents, his sister and him. Minh's father is an engineer. Everyday he goes to work at 7 o'clock. Minh's mother is a doctor. She works in a hospital in the town. She goes to work at 6.30. Minh's sister is a student at Hanoi National University. She is twenty years old. Minh is twelve. He is a student at Quang Trung School.",_="Lunar New Year, or Tet, is the biggest and most important festival in Vietnam. Tet often falls between late January and early February.<br>A great deal of excitement still builds up well before Tet. Streets are decorated with coloured lights and red banners. Shops are full of goods. People are busy buying gifts, cleaning and decorating their houses and cooking traditional foods.<br>Homes are often decorated with plants and flowers at this time. Peach blossom is traditional at Tet in the North while apricot blossom is traditional in the South. One of Tet's most special foods is banh chung, which is made of sticky rice, green beans and fatty pork.<br>On the days of Tet, people visit other family members or friends and they exchange New Year's wishes. Children receive their “lucky money” inside red envelopes. Many people go to pagodas to pray for a happy new year for themselves and their families. Both children and adults take part in games and various forms of entertainment. Tet is really a time of fun and festivals throughout the country.",l="Newquay is a small town (21) __________ the Atlantic coast in the south of England. It has got great beaches and is the best place to surf in the UK.<br>In Newquay, there are lots of other things to do as (22) __________ as surfing. If you like water sports, you can go kayaking, water-skiing or coasteering. Coasteering is different because it is rock climbing, jumping into the sea, and swimming in the same activity, but you (23) __________ always go with a special instructor.<br>If you like animals you can also visit the Blue Reef Aquarium and (24) __________ a lot of different fish and even sharks. You can also go (25) __________ on the beach or visit Newquay Zoo. Come and see for yourself.",m="Nha Trang is one of the most important tourist hubs of Vietnam, thanks to its beautiful beaches with fine and clean sand and the clear ocean water with mild temperature all year round. There are several resorts - such as Vinpearl, Diamond Bay and Ana Mandara - and amusement and water parks, both in the city and on islands off the coast. The possibly most beautiful street of Nha Trang is Tran Phu Street along the seaside, sometimes referred to as the Pacific Coast Highway of Vietnam.<br>Lying off Nha Trang is the Hon Tre Island (Bamboo Island), with a major resort operated by the Vin Group. The Vinpearl Cable Car, a gondola lift system, links the mainland to the five-star resort and theme park on Hon Tre Island.",d="My name is Linh. I am lucky enough to have a lot of friends. Of all my friends, Nga and Mai are the ones I spend most of my time with. Each of us, however, has a different character. Nga is tall and she has short curly black hair. She is sociable. She often spends her free time on outdoor activities. She is a hard-working student who always gets good grades. Unlike Nga, Mai is quite reserved in public. She like the peace and quiet of the school library. She often helps me with Maths homework. I am not outgoing as Nga, but I like telling jokes, and my friends usually like my sense of humour. My jokes make them laugh a lot. We are very close friends.",p="Tet is an important holiday in Vietnam. Before Tet, people buy fruits and flowers. They also clean and (16) ………… their houses. (17) ………… New Year's Eve, Vietnamese people eat traditional food such as Tet cake or boiled chicken with their families. During Tet, they wear new clothes and (18) ………… their family and friends. Children like Tet (19) ………… they get lucky money and don't go to school. Tet is a good (20) ………… for families and friends have fun together.",b="Hi! My name's Nam. I live in a (21) ………… in Ba Ria Ward. I live with my parents, my two brothers and my sister. Our house is large. There is a big kitchen, a dining room, a (22) ………… living room and a toilet. There is also a separate room (23) ………… our washing machine, dishwasher and freezer. Upstairs, there are five bedrooms, two bathrooms and another toilet. Outside, there is a small garden where we often sit and (24) ………… afternoon tea. Our house is next to a shopping center so it's (25) ………… convenient.",g="Tet is the most important festival in Vietnam. It usually takes place in late January or early February. Before Tet, people clean their houses and decorate them with colorful flowers. On the first day of Tet, families gather to enjoy special food like “banh chung” and give lucky money to children. People visit their relatives and friends to wish them a happy and healthy new year. Many families also go to pagodas to pray for good luck. Tet is a time for everyone to relax and enjoy moments of peace and happiness.",s="I. USE OF ENGLISH (6 marks)",W="II. READING (3 marks) — Part 1 (1 mark)",y="II. READING (3 marks) — Part 2 (2 marks)",w="III. WRITING (1 mark)",f="I. Find the word whose underlined part is pronounced differently (1,25 điểm)",k="II. Choose the odd one out (1,25 điểm)",o="III. Choose the best answer A, B, C or D (2,5 điểm)",H="IV. Find the mistake of each sentence (1 điểm)",M="V. Read the passage and circle the best option (1 điểm)",N="VI. Read the passage and write T (true) or F (false) (1 điểm)",D="VII. Write the full sentences. Use the words given (1 điểm)",P="VIII. Rewrite the sentences so that their meaning stays the same (1 điểm)",i="II) Language (20 pts → 3,33 điểm)",h="III) Reading (20 pts → 3,33 điểm)",r="IV) Writing (20 pts → 3,33 điểm)",C="B. READING — I. Choose the best option (1,25 → 2,5 điểm)",v="B. READING — II. Choose the word that best suits the blank (1,25 → 2,5 điểm)",G="C. WRITING — I. Find the underlined item that needs correcting (0,5 → 1 điểm)",R="C. WRITING — II. Rewrite the sentences without changing their meaning (1 → 2 điểm)",K="C. WRITING — III. Write an essay (1 → 2 điểm)",V="II. PHONETICS (1.0 pt → 1,11 điểm)",a="III. MULTIPLE CHOICE (3.0 pts → 3,33 điểm)",T="IV. READING — Part A (1.25 pts → 1,39 điểm)",x="IV. READING — Part B (1.25 pts → 1,39 điểm)",j="V. USE THE CORRECT FORM OF THE WORDS (1 pt → 1,11 điểm)",E="VI. DO AS DIRECTED (1.5 pts → 1,67 điểm)",t=.3333,n=.2778,L=.5556;TA6CK.push({id:16201,title:"CK1 · TH-THCS Thắng Lợi (Kon Tum) 2021–2022",time:60,sem:1,book:"Right on!",src:"https://tailieu.vn/doc/de-thi-hoc-ki-1-tieng-anh-lop-6-2754637.html",questions:[{sec:s,name:"Câu 1",pts:.25,text:"There's a ………… next to my house. My mum and dad's car is there.",opts:o4("balcony","garage","bedroom","stairs"),ans:"B",why:"Chỗ để ô tô của bố mẹ là <b>garage</b> (nhà để xe). Balcony = ban công, bedroom = phòng ngủ, stairs = cầu thang."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 2",pts:.25,text:"I like cooking. The ………… is my favourite room.",opts:o4("bathroom","garden","kitchen","living room"),ans:"C",why:"Thích nấu ăn → phòng yêu thích là <b>kitchen</b> (bếp)."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 3",pts:.25,text:"The books are ………… the bookcase.",opts:o4("on","above","below","next"),ans:"A",why:"Sách đặt <b>on</b> the bookcase (trên giá sách). “next” phải có “to”; above / below là phía trên / phía dưới giá, không hợp với sách để trên giá."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 4",pts:.25,text:"Sandra has got a lot of friends. She's very …………",opts:o4("plump","fun","friendly","clever"),ans:"C",why:"Có nhiều bạn vì thân thiện → <b>friendly</b>. Plump = mũm mĩm (ngoại hình), clever = thông minh — không giải thích việc có nhiều bạn."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 5",pts:.25,text:"Don't stand ………… the TV. I'm watching the programme.",opts:o4("in front of","opposite","next","near"),ans:"A",why:"Đứng <b>in front of</b> the TV (trước TV) thì che mất màn hình, người đang xem mới nhắc. “next” thiếu “to”."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 6",pts:.25,text:"I have got ………… posters of my favourite singer ………… the wall.",opts:o4("any / on","some / on","a / above","some / in"),ans:"B",why:"Câu khẳng định với danh từ số nhiều dùng <b>some</b>; tranh dán <b>on</b> the wall (trên tường). “any” dùng cho câu phủ định / câu hỏi; “a” không đi với “posters”."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 7",pts:.25,text:"I like going to the ………… with my friends to watch films.",opts:o4("supermarket","theatre","museum","cinema"),ans:"D",why:"Xem phim → đến <b>cinema</b> (rạp chiếu phim). Theatre là nhà hát (xem kịch)."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 8",pts:.25,text:"Student A: Have your parents got a car?<br>Student B: …………",opts:o4("Yes, they are.","Yes, they got.","Yes, there are.","Yes, they have."),ans:"D",why:"Câu hỏi “Have … got …?” trả lời bằng trợ động từ <b>have</b>: Yes, they have. / No, they haven't."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 9",pts:.25,text:"What does the sign mean?",img:I+"e16201-c9.svg",opts:o4("There aren't any bicycles here.","You can ride your bike here.","Don't ride your bike here.","There are some bicycles here."),ans:"C",why:"Hình xe đạp trong vòng tròn có gạch chéo là biển CẤM → <b>Don't ride your bike here</b> (cấm đi xe đạp)."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 10",pts:.25,text:"What does the sign mean?",img:I+"e16201-c10.svg",opts:o4("Don't run in the museum.","Let's run in the museum.","Children can run in the museum.","You can run in the museum."),ans:"A",why:"Người đang chạy bị gạch chéo → biển cấm chạy: <b>Don't run in the museum</b>. Ba phương án còn lại đều cho phép chạy."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 11",pts:.25,text:"Susan and I often ………… board games at her house.",opts:o4("play","do","has","enjoys"),ans:"A",why:"<b>play</b> board games (chơi trò chơi trên bàn). Chủ ngữ “Susan and I” số nhiều nên không dùng “has / enjoys”."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 12",pts:.25,text:"I really like singing, so I ………… miss my singing lessons.",opts:o4("always","usually","sometimes","never"),ans:"D",why:"Rất thích hát nên <b>never</b> miss (không bao giờ bỏ) buổi học hát."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 13",pts:.25,text:"We often go on a school trip ………… the summer.",opts:o4("on","in","at","with"),ans:"B",why:"Mùa trong năm dùng <b>in</b>: in the summer."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 14",pts:.25,text:"Student A: ………… dog is this?<br>Student B: It's Fred's dog.",opts:o4("Who","Whose","What","Which"),ans:"B",why:"Trả lời chỉ chủ sở hữu (Fred's dog) → hỏi bằng <b>Whose</b> (của ai)."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 15",pts:.25,text:"………… is my favourite subject. I love doing sports, especially badminton. I'm in the school team, too.",opts:o4("Science","Maths","Music","PE"),ans:"D",why:"Thích chơi thể thao, cầu lông → môn <b>PE</b> (thể dục)."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 16",pts:.25,text:"Every morning, I have breakfast at 6 o'clock, ………… I walk to school.",opts:o4("then","first","after","next to"),ans:"A",why:"Kể việc nối tiếp: ăn sáng, <b>then</b> (sau đó) đi bộ đến trường."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 17",pts:.25,text:"Nick's mum ………… lunch for him. He buys lunch from the school canteen.",opts:o4("don't make","doesn't prepare","cooks","makes"),ans:"B",why:"Nick tự mua bữa trưa ở căng tin → mẹ KHÔNG chuẩn bị bữa trưa: <b>doesn't prepare</b>. “don't make” sai vì chủ ngữ số ít (phải là doesn't)."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 18",pts:.25,text:"I'm thirsty. Can I have ………… water, please?",opts:o4("any","a few","some","a lot"),ans:"C",why:"Lời xin / mời dùng <b>some</b> với danh từ không đếm được (water). “a few” cho danh từ đếm được; “a lot” thiếu “of”."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 19",pts:.25,text:"A: How ………… orange juice do you want?<br>B: ………… carton, please.",opts:o4("many / A","much / Some","much / A","many / A little"),ans:"C",why:"Orange juice không đếm được → How <b>much</b>; “carton” (hộp) đếm được, số ít → <b>A</b> carton."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 20",pts:.25,text:"We need to go shopping today. We haven't got ………… food left.",opts:o4("a lot","any","some","a little"),ans:"B",why:"Câu phủ định (haven't got) dùng <b>any</b>."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 21",pts:.25,text:"I prefer studying in the library because it's ………… than my house.",opts:o4("the most quiet","quieter","the quietest","more quiet"),ans:"B",why:"Có “than” → so sánh hơn. Quiet là tính từ ngắn → <b>quieter</b>."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 22",pts:.25,text:"I like ………… fresh fruit to yoghurt to have a nice, healthy dessert.",opts:o4("peeling","mixing","adding","making"),ans:"C",why:"<b>add</b> something <b>to</b> something = cho thêm cái gì vào cái gì: thêm trái cây tươi vào sữa chua."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 23",pts:.25,text:"Choose the word whose underlined part is pronounced differently.",opts:o4("b<u>o</u>wl","ch<u>o</u>p","b<u>o</u>ttle","c<u>o</u>ffee"),ans:"A",why:"bowl /bəʊl/ đọc /əʊ/; chop /tʃɒp/, bottle /ˈbɒtl/, coffee /ˈkɒfi/ đọc /ɒ/."},{sec:s,name:"Câu 24",pts:.25,text:"I will ………… the cake into ten pieces.",opts:o4("grate","slice","chop","peel"),ans:"B",why:"Cắt bánh thành từng miếng → <b>slice</b>. Grate = bào, chop = băm/chặt nhỏ, peel = gọt vỏ."},{sec:W,name:"Part 1 – 1",pts:.25,read:B,text:"Pablo and his brother study at the same school.",opts:S,ans:"A",why:"Right. “He goes to the same school as me.”"},{sec:W,name:"Part 1 – 2",pts:.25,read:B,text:"Pablo is older than his brother.",opts:S,ans:"B",why:"Wrong. Pablo 11 tuổi, anh trai 14 tuổi → anh trai lớn hơn."},{sec:W,name:"Part 1 – 3",pts:.25,read:B,text:"Pablo usually eats breakfast.",opts:S,ans:"B",why:"Wrong. “I don't eat breakfast because I haven't got time. I just drink a glass of milk.”"},{sec:W,name:"Part 1 – 4",pts:.25,read:B,text:"Pablo likes drinking mango juice.",opts:S,ans:"A",why:"Right. “We have mango juice, too – my favourite.”"},{sec:y,name:"Part 2 – 1",pts:.4,type:"write",lines:2,read:c,text:"Why was Tom nervous at first?",model:"<b>Đáp án của trường:</b> Because the teachers are all new to him, most of his classmates are new too.<br>Chấp nhận câu trả lời đúng ý (thầy cô và phần lớn bạn cùng lớp đều mới), ví dụ: <i>Because his teachers and most of his classmates are new.</i>",why:"Tom: “The teachers are all new to me, most of my classmates are new too.” Khi trả lời đổi “me / my” thành “him / his”."},{sec:y,name:"Part 2 – 2",pts:.4,read:c,text:"What is his favourite subject?",...e(["His favourite subject is computer studies."],["His favorite subject is computer studies."],["It is computer studies."],["It's computer studies."],["Computer studies."],["Computer studies is his favourite subject."],["His favourite subject is computer studies"],["computer studies"],["his favourite subject is computer study"],["His favorite subject is computer study"]),why:"“… computer studies, my favourite subject.” → His favourite subject is computer studies."},{sec:y,name:"Part 2 – 3",pts:.4,read:c,text:"Is Tom having a nice first week at his new school?",...e(["Yes, he is."],["Yes"],["Yes, he is having a nice first week."],["Yes, he is having a nice first week at his new school."]),why:"Tom nói tuần đầu “it's great”, “I had a good first day” → Yes, he is. (Câu hỏi “Is Tom …?” trả lời “Yes, he is.”)"},{sec:y,name:"Part 2 – 4",pts:.4,read:c,text:"What are Tom's teachers and friends like?",...e(["They are all nice to him."],["They're all nice to him."],["They are nice to him."],["They're nice to him."],["They are all nice."],["They are nice."],["They are all nice and friendly."],["They are nice and friendly."],["They are friendly."],["Nice."],["They are all nice to Tom."]),why:"Tom: “They are all nice to me.” → They are all nice to him."},{sec:y,name:"Part 2 – 5",pts:.4,read:c,text:"What club does he want to join?",...e(["He wants to join the judo club."],["He wants to join judo club."],["He wants to join the judo club at school."],["The judo club."],["Judo club."],["Judo."],["He wants to join the school judo club."]),why:"Tom: “Dad, can I join the judo club at school?” → He wants to join the judo club."},{sec:w,name:"Writing 1",pts:.2,text:"Rearrange the words to make a complete sentence:<br><i>are / late / for / They / sometimes / school /.</i>",...e(["They are sometimes late for school."],["Sometimes they are late for school."]),why:"Trạng từ tần suất đứng SAU động từ “to be”: They <b>are sometimes</b> late for school (be late for = đến … muộn)."},{sec:w,name:"Writing 2",pts:.2,text:"Rearrange the words to make a complete sentence:<br><i>is / sugary / than / drinks / Water / healthier /.</i>",...e(["Water is healthier than sugary drinks."]),why:"So sánh hơn: A is <b>healthier than</b> B. “Water” viết hoa nên đứng đầu câu."},{sec:w,name:"Writing 3",pts:.2,text:"Rearrange the words to make a complete sentence:<br><i>in / don't / afternoon / I / coffee / the / much / drink /.</i>",...e(["I don't drink much coffee in the afternoon."],["In the afternoon, I don't drink much coffee."],["I do not drink much coffee in the afternoon."],["In the afternoon I do not drink much coffee."]),why:"I don't drink <b>much</b> coffee (much + danh từ không đếm được, dùng trong câu phủ định) + in the afternoon."},{sec:w,name:"Writing 4",pts:.2,text:"Rearrange the words to make a complete sentence:<br><i>is / coffee / There / under / a / carpet / the / table /.</i>",...e(["There is a carpet under the coffee table."],["There's a carpet under the coffee table."]),why:"There is + a + danh từ số ít + vị trí: There is a carpet <b>under the coffee table</b> (coffee table = bàn uống nước)."},{sec:w,name:"Writing 5",pts:.2,text:"Rearrange the words to make a complete sentence:<br><i>a / recipe / butter / need / for / little / this / We /.</i>",...e(["We need a little butter for this recipe."],["For this recipe we need a little butter."]),why:"<b>a little</b> + danh từ không đếm được (butter); for this recipe = cho công thức này."}]},{id:16202,title:"CK1 · THCS Yên Phương (Vĩnh Phúc) 2022–2023",time:60,sem:1,book:"Global Success",src:"https://tailieu.vn/doc/de-thi-hoc-ki-1-tieng-anh-lop-6-co-dap-an-2709712.html",questions:[{sec:f,name:"Câu 1",pts:.25,text:"Find the word whose underlined part is pronounced differently from the rest.",opts:o4("l<u>ea</u>ve","br<u>ea</u>k","rep<u>ea</u>t","p<u>ea</u>ceful"),ans:"B",why:"break /breɪk/ đọc /eɪ/; leave, repeat, peaceful đọc /iː/."},{sec:f,name:"Câu 2",pts:.25,text:"Find the word whose underlined part is pronounced differently from the rest.",opts:o4("elb<u>o</u>w","b<u>o</u>wl","c<u>o</u>w","sh<u>o</u>w"),ans:"C",why:"cow /kaʊ/ đọc /aʊ/; elbow, bowl, show đọc /əʊ/."},{sec:f,name:"Câu 3",pts:.25,text:"Find the word whose underlined part is pronounced differently from the rest.",opts:o4("d<u>e</u>sert","cel<u>e</u>brate","for<u>e</u>st","<u>e</u>xpensive"),ans:"A",why:"desert /ˈdezət/ — chữ e đọc /e/; celebrate /ˈselɪbreɪt/, forest /ˈfɒrɪst/, expensive /ɪkˈspensɪv/ — chữ e gạch chân đọc /ɪ/."},{sec:f,name:"Câu 4",pts:.25,text:"Find the word whose underlined part is pronounced differently from the rest.",opts:o4("couch<u>es</u>","box<u>es</u>","hous<u>es</u>","tabl<u>es</u>"),ans:"D",why:"Sau âm /tʃ/, /ks/, /z/ thì “es” đọc /ɪz/: couches, boxes, houses. tables /ˈteɪblz/ — “es” chỉ đọc /z/."},{sec:f,name:"Câu 5",pts:.25,text:"Find the word whose underlined part is pronounced differently from the rest.",opts:o4("spe<u>c</u>ial","<u>s</u>pring","<u>s</u>chool","<u>s</u>ummer"),ans:"A",why:"special /ˈspeʃl/ — “c” đọc /ʃ/; spring, school, summer — “s” đọc /s/."},{sec:k,name:"Câu 6",pts:.25,text:"Choose the odd one out.",opts:o4("hand","head","chin","sink"),ans:"D",why:"hand, head, chin là bộ phận cơ thể; <b>sink</b> (bồn rửa) là đồ trong nhà."},{sec:k,name:"Câu 7",pts:.25,text:"Choose the odd one out.",opts:o4("desk","ruler","fridge","book"),ans:"C",why:"desk, ruler, book là đồ dùng học tập; <b>fridge</b> (tủ lạnh) là đồ trong nhà."},{sec:k,name:"Câu 8",pts:.25,text:"Choose the odd one out.",opts:o4("grocery","restaurant","cafe","fireworks"),ans:"D",why:"grocery, restaurant, cafe là nơi chốn trong khu phố; <b>fireworks</b> (pháo hoa) không phải nơi chốn."},{sec:k,name:"Câu 9",pts:.25,text:"Choose the odd one out.",opts:o4("lake","valley","cave","club"),ans:"D",why:"lake, valley, cave là cảnh thiên nhiên; <b>club</b> (câu lạc bộ) thì không."},{sec:k,name:"Câu 10",pts:.25,text:"Choose the odd one out.",opts:o4("larger","taller","worker","shorter"),ans:"C",why:"larger, taller, shorter là tính từ so sánh hơn (-er); <b>worker</b> (công nhân) là danh từ."},{sec:o,name:"Câu 11",pts:.25,text:"She ………… English from 7.00 a.m to 5.00 p.m every day.",opts:o4("is teaching","taught","teach","teaches"),ans:"D",why:"“every day” → thì hiện tại đơn; chủ ngữ “She” → <b>teaches</b>."},{sec:o,name:"Câu 12",pts:.25,text:"This building is ………… than that one.",opts:o4("beautifuler","beautiful","more beautiful","more beautifuler"),ans:"C",why:"Beautiful là tính từ dài → so sánh hơn: <b>more beautiful</b> than."},{sec:o,name:"Câu 13",pts:.25,text:"Nam ………… football now.",opts:o4("plays","is playing","played","has played"),ans:"B",why:"“now” → hiện tại tiếp diễn: Nam <b>is playing</b>."},{sec:o,name:"Câu 14",pts:.25,text:"Take the second ………… on your left. It's on your right.",opts:o4("turn","turns","turning","turnings"),ans:"C",why:"Chỉ đường: Take the second <b>turning</b> on your left = rẽ vào ngã rẽ thứ hai bên trái (sau “the second” dùng danh từ số ít)."},{sec:o,name:"Câu 15",pts:.25,text:"How many ………… are there in the classroom?",opts:o4("tables","fan","board","window"),ans:"A",why:"How many + danh từ số nhiều → <b>tables</b>. Ba phương án còn lại là số ít."},{sec:o,name:"Câu 16",pts:.25,text:"In ………… lessons, we learn about writers, poems and write essays.",opts:o4("History","Literature","Science","Geography"),ans:"B",why:"Học về nhà văn, thơ, viết bài luận → môn <b>Literature</b> (Ngữ văn)."},{sec:o,name:"Câu 17",pts:.25,text:"You ………… speak Vietnamese in English class.",opts:o4("must","mustn't","should","will"),ans:"B",why:"Nội quy giờ Tiếng Anh: không được nói tiếng Việt → <b>mustn't</b> (cấm)."},{sec:o,name:"Câu 18",pts:.25,text:"My father always goes ………… a walk in the early morning.",opts:o4("to","on","in","for"),ans:"D",why:"Cụm cố định: go <b>for</b> a walk = đi dạo."},{sec:o,name:"Câu 19",pts:.25,text:"Is there a yard behind her house? No, there …………",opts:o4("is","are","isn't","aren't"),ans:"C",why:"Câu hỏi “Is there …?” trả lời phủ định: No, there <b>isn't</b>."},{sec:o,name:"Câu 20",pts:.25,text:"At Tet, we decorate our houses with ………… flowers.",opts:o4("orange","peach","rose","mango"),ans:"B",why:"Tết (miền Bắc) trang trí nhà bằng hoa đào: <b>peach</b> flowers."},{sec:H,name:"Câu 21",pts:.25,text:"Find the mistake:<br><u>Would</u><sup>A</sup> <u>you</u><sup>B</sup> like <u>any</u><sup>C</sup> cup <u>of</u><sup>D</sup> tea?",opts:o4("Would","you","any","of"),ans:"C",why:"Lời mời dùng “a / some”, không dùng “any”; “cup” số ít → sửa <b>any → a</b>: Would you like a cup of tea?"},{sec:H,name:"Câu 22",pts:.25,text:"Find the mistake:<br><u>Ha Long Bay</u><sup>A</sup> is <u>one of</u><sup>B</sup> <u>the best</u><sup>C</sup> natural <u>wonder</u><sup>D</sup> of Vietnam.",opts:o4("Ha Long Bay","one of","the best","wonder"),ans:"D",why:"“one of the + so sánh nhất + danh từ SỐ NHIỀU” → sửa <b>wonder → wonders</b>."},{sec:H,name:"Câu 23",pts:.25,text:"Find the mistake:<br>Would <u>you</u><sup>A</sup> <u>like</u><sup>B</sup> <u>learning</u><sup>C</sup> to <u>make</u><sup>D</sup> Chung cake?",opts:o4("you","like","learning","make"),ans:"C",why:"Would you like + <b>to V</b> → sửa <b>learning → to learn</b>."},{sec:H,name:"Câu 24",pts:.25,text:"Find the mistake:<br>I don't <u>have</u><sup>A</sup> <u>some</u><sup>B</sup> homework <u>to do</u><sup>C</sup> <u>at</u><sup>D</sup> Tet.",opts:o4("have","some","to do","at"),ans:"B",why:"Câu phủ định dùng “any” → sửa <b>some → any</b>."},{sec:M,name:"Câu 25",pts:.25,read:A,text:"There are ………… people in Minh's family.",opts:o4("three","four","five","seven"),ans:"B",why:"“There are four people in Minh's family.”"},{sec:M,name:"Câu 26",pts:.25,read:A,text:"His father is a(n) …………",opts:o4("worker","driver","engineer","teacher"),ans:"C",why:"“Minh's father is an engineer.”"},{sec:M,name:"Câu 27",pts:.25,read:A,text:"Minh's sister is ………… years old.",opts:o4("12","20","22","21"),ans:"B",why:"“She is twenty years old.” (12 là tuổi của Minh.)"},{sec:M,name:"Câu 28",pts:.25,read:A,text:"Minh studies at …………",opts:o4("Tran Phu School","Le Duan School","Quang Trung School","Hanoi National University"),ans:"C",why:"“He is a student at Quang Trung School.” Hanoi National University là trường của chị Minh."},{sec:N,name:"Câu 29",pts:.25,read:_,text:"Tet often falls between late January and early February.",opts:u,ans:"A",why:"True. Câu thứ hai của bài: “Tet often falls between late January and early February.”"},{sec:N,name:"Câu 30",pts:.25,read:_,text:"Peach blossom is traditional at Tet in the South.",opts:u,ans:"B",why:"False. Hoa đào là của miền Bắc (in the North); miền Nam là hoa mai (apricot blossom)."},{sec:N,name:"Câu 31",pts:.25,read:_,text:"Children receive their “lucky money” inside red envelopes.",opts:u,ans:"A",why:"True. “Children receive their ‘lucky money’ inside red envelopes.”"},{sec:N,name:"Câu 32",pts:.25,read:_,text:"Children take part in games and various forms of entertainment.",opts:u,ans:"A",why:"True. Bài viết: “<b>Both children and adults</b> take part in games and various forms of entertainment” — trẻ em có tham gia. (HD chấm của trường ghi F là nhầm.)"},{sec:D,name:"Câu 33",pts:.25,text:"Write the full sentence: <i>There / in / many trees / my school / are /.</i>",...e(["There are many trees in my school."],["There are many trees at my school."]),why:"There are + danh từ số nhiều (many trees) + in my school."},{sec:D,name:"Câu 34",pts:.25,text:"Write the full sentence: <i>The Mekong River / long / the Red River.</i>",...e(["The Mekong River is longer than the Red River."]),why:"So sánh hơn của tính từ ngắn: long → <b>longer than</b>; thêm động từ “is”."},{sec:D,name:"Câu 35",pts:.25,text:"Write the full sentence: <i>Children / play games / shouldn't / all night.</i>",...e(["Children shouldn't play games all night."],["Children should not play games all night."]),why:"shouldn't + động từ nguyên thể: Children <b>shouldn't play</b> games all night."},{sec:D,name:"Câu 36",pts:.25,text:"Write the full sentence: <i>My brother's room / next to / is / my room.</i>",...e(["My brother's room is next to my room."],["My brother's room is next to mine."]),why:"Chủ ngữ “My brother's room” + is + next to + my room."},{sec:P,name:"Câu 37",pts:.25,text:"Let's go camping.<br>→ What about …………………………?",...e(["What about going camping?"]),why:"What about + <b>V-ing</b> → What about going camping?"},{sec:P,name:"Câu 38",pts:.25,text:"My house is smaller than her house.<br>→ Her house …………………………",...e(["Her house is ",["bigger","larger"]," than ",["my house.","mine."]]),why:"Đảo hai vế thì đổi tính từ sang nghĩa ngược: smaller ↔ <b>bigger</b> (larger). Her house is bigger than my house."},{sec:P,name:"Câu 39",pts:.25,text:"Does your school have 15 classes?<br>→ Are there …………………………?",...e(["Are there ",["15","fifteen"]," classes ",["in","at"]," your school?"]),why:"“have” (có) ↔ “there are … in …”: Are there 15 classes in your school?"},{sec:P,name:"Câu 40",pts:.25,text:"It is not good to watch TV too much.<br>→ You shouldn't …………………………",...e(["You shouldn't watch TV too much."],["You should not watch TV too much."]),why:"“It is not good to V” = “You shouldn't V” (không nên)."}]},{id:16203,title:"CK1 · THCS Ngô Gia Tự (Hà Nội) 2023–2024",time:60,sem:1,book:"Global Success",src:"https://tailieu.vn/doc/de-thi-hoc-ki-1-tieng-anh-lop-6-co-dap-an-2734538.html",questions:[{sec:i,name:"Question 11",pts:t,text:"Choose the word whose underlined part differs from the others in pronunciation.",opts:o4("<u>c</u>ity","<u>c</u>ircle","spe<u>c</u>ial","pla<u>c</u>e"),ans:"C",why:"special — “c” đọc /ʃ/; city, circle, place — “c” đứng trước i, e đọc /s/."},{sec:i,name:"Question 12",pts:t,text:"Choose the word whose underlined part differs from the others in pronunciation.",opts:o4("h<u>i</u>storic","r<u>i</u>ce","publ<u>i</u>c","v<u>i</u>llage"),ans:"B",why:"rice /raɪs/ — “i” đọc /aɪ/; historic, public, village — “i” đọc /ɪ/."},{sec:i,name:"Question 13",pts:t,text:"Choose the word that differs from the others in the position of primary stress.",opts:o4("valley","cuisine","sandy","wonder"),ans:"B",why:"cuisine /kwɪˈziːn/ nhấn âm 2; valley, sandy, wonder nhấn âm 1."},{sec:i,name:"Question 14",pts:t,text:"Choose the word that differs from the others in the position of primary stress.",opts:o4("remove","behave","alone","temple"),ans:"D",why:"temple /ˈtempl/ nhấn âm 1; remove, behave, alone nhấn âm 2."},{sec:i,name:"Question 15",pts:t,text:"People often spend time visiting their ………… during Tet.",opts:o4("relatives","teachers","friends","neighbours"),ans:"A",why:"Tết thường đi thăm họ hàng: <b>relatives</b> — hoạt động tiêu biểu nhất trong bài Tết của SGK."},{sec:i,name:"Question 16",pts:t,text:"You ………… ask other people for lucky money. It ………… very polite.",opts:o4("shouldn't / is","should / is","shouldn't / isn't","should / isn't"),ans:"C",why:"Xin tiền lì xì là không lịch sự → You <b>shouldn't</b> ask…; It <b>isn't</b> very polite. Hai vế phải cùng ý."},{sec:i,name:"Question 17",pts:t,text:"The weather in Ho Chi Minh City is ………… that in Da Lat City.",opts:o4("hotter than","hotter","hot than","more hot"),ans:"A",why:"So sánh hơn tính từ ngắn: hot → <b>hotter than</b> (gấp đôi phụ âm t). Thiếu “than” hoặc “more hot” đều sai."},{sec:i,name:"Question 18",pts:t,text:"There aren't ………… strawberries on the cake.",opts:o4("some","a little","many","much"),ans:"C",why:"Strawberries đếm được, số nhiều, câu phủ định → <b>many</b>. Much / a little dùng cho danh từ không đếm được; some không dùng trong câu phủ định."},{sec:i,name:"Question 19",pts:t,text:"“Excuse me! Is there a post office near here?” – “…………”",opts:o4("My pleasure.","No. Let's walk there.","Yes, there is one at the next corner.","That's a good idea."),ans:"C",why:"Câu hỏi “Is there …?” → trả lời “Yes, there is …” và chỉ chỗ: <b>Yes, there is one at the next corner.</b>"},{sec:i,name:"Question 20",pts:t,text:"Choose the word OPPOSITE in meaning to the underlined word:<br>Life in Ha Noi is more <u>expensive</u> than that in Da Lat.",opts:o4("reasonable","small","costly","delicious"),ans:"A",why:"expensive (đắt) >< <b>reasonable</b> (giá phải chăng). Costly đồng nghĩa với expensive."},{sec:h,name:"Question 21",pts:t,read:l,text:"Choose the correct word for blank (21).",opts:o4("in","on","at","to"),ans:"B",why:"Thị trấn nằm <b>on</b> the coast (trên bờ biển)."},{sec:h,name:"Question 22",pts:t,read:l,text:"Choose the correct word for blank (22).",opts:o4("well","much","soon","far"),ans:"A",why:"Cụm <b>as well as</b> = cũng như, ngoài … ra."},{sec:h,name:"Question 23",pts:t,read:l,text:"Choose the correct word for blank (23).",opts:o4("shall","may","could","should"),ans:"D",why:"Lời khuyên vì an toàn: you <b>should</b> always go with a special instructor (luôn nên đi cùng người hướng dẫn)."},{sec:h,name:"Question 24",pts:t,read:l,text:"Choose the correct word for blank (24).",opts:o4("get","like","see","look"),ans:"C",why:"Đến thủy cung để <b>see</b> (ngắm, xem) cá và cá mập. “look” phải có “at”."},{sec:h,name:"Question 25",pts:t,read:l,text:"Choose the correct word for blank (25).",opts:o4("horse ride","horse riding","riding horse","ride horse"),ans:"B",why:"go + V-ing chỉ hoạt động: go <b>horse riding</b> (đi cưỡi ngựa)."},{sec:h,name:"Question 26",pts:t,read:m,text:"Why is Nha Trang one of the most important tourist hubs of Viet Nam?",opts:o4("Because it has many beautiful islands and fine sand.","Because it has mild temperatures in the summer.","Because it has beautiful beaches and clear, clean water.","Because it has fine clean sand and mild temperatures."),ans:"C",why:"“thanks to its <b>beautiful beaches</b> … and the <b>clear ocean water</b>…”. A sai (bài không nói nhiều đảo đẹp là lí do), B sai (ấm áp quanh năm, không chỉ mùa hè), D chỉ nêu cát và nhiệt độ mà bỏ mất ý chính “bãi biển đẹp” → chọn C (đáp án của trường)."},{sec:h,name:"Question 27",pts:t,read:m,text:"Diamond Bay is the name of a/an …………",opts:o4("water park","amusement park","island","resort"),ans:"D",why:"“There are several <b>resorts</b> - such as Vinpearl, Diamond Bay and Ana Mandara”."},{sec:h,name:"Question 28",pts:t,read:m,text:"Where are resorts and parks?",opts:o4("In the city only","In the city and on islands","On the islands only","On islands and off the coast"),ans:"B",why:"“… both <b>in the city and on islands</b> off the coast.”"},{sec:h,name:"Question 29",pts:t,read:m,text:"The Pacific Coast Highway of Viet Nam refers to ………… in Nha Trang.",opts:o4("Hon Tre Island","Vinpearl Group","Tran Phu Street","Ana Mandara Resort"),ans:"C",why:"“… <b>Tran Phu Street</b> along the seaside, sometimes referred to as the Pacific Coast Highway of Vietnam.”"},{sec:h,name:"Question 30",pts:t,read:m,text:"The Vinpearl Cable Car is a …………",opts:o4("Five-star resort","Gondola lift system","Theme park","Mainland link"),ans:"B",why:"“The Vinpearl Cable Car, <b>a gondola lift system</b>, links the mainland to …”"},{sec:r,name:"Question 31",pts:t,text:"Choose the underlined part that needs correction:<br>Mai <u>always</u> <u>helps</u> her mother <u>in</u> the <u>housework</u>.",opts:o4("always","in","helps","housework"),ans:"B",why:"Cấu trúc help somebody <b>with</b> something → sửa <b>in → with</b>."},{sec:r,name:"Question 32",pts:t,text:"Choose the underlined part that needs correction:<br>How <u>much</u> litres of <u>water</u> <u>do you think</u> this huge bottle <u>contains</u>?",opts:o4("much","water","do you think","contains"),ans:"A",why:"“litres” là danh từ đếm được số nhiều → How <b>many</b> litres. Sửa <b>much → many</b>."},{sec:r,name:"Question 33",pts:t,text:"Rearrange the words to make a meaningful sentence:<br><i>drivers / All / must / have / license. / a / driving</i>",...e(["All drivers must have a driving ",["license.","licence."]]),why:"“All” viết hoa đứng đầu câu: All drivers + must + have + a driving license."},{sec:r,name:"Question 34",pts:t,text:"Rearrange the words to make a meaningful sentence:<br><i>She / does / homework / not / every / her / evening. / do</i>",...e(["She does not do her homework every evening."],["She doesn't do her homework every evening."]),why:"Phủ định hiện tại đơn: She <b>does not do</b> her homework + every evening."},{sec:r,name:"Question 35",pts:t,text:"Our school has forty-two classrooms.<br>→ There …………………………",...e(["There are ",["forty-two","42","forty two"]," classrooms ",["in","at"]," our school."]),why:"“has” = “There are … in …”: There are forty-two classrooms in our school."},{sec:r,name:"Question 36",pts:t,text:"My father usually drives to work.<br>→ My father usually goes …………………………",...e(["My father usually goes to work by car."],["My father usually goes by car to work."]),why:"drive to work = go to work <b>by car</b>."},{sec:r,name:"Question 37",pts:t,text:"Write a meaningful sentence based on the cued words:<br><i>The Pacific Ocean / deep / the Arctic Ocean.</i>",...e(["The Pacific Ocean is deeper than the Arctic Ocean."]),why:"So sánh hơn tính từ ngắn: deep → <b>deeper than</b>; thêm “is”."},{sec:r,name:"Question 38",pts:t,text:"Write a meaningful sentence based on the cued words:<br><i>My cousin / school / have / 18 / classes / about / 800 / students.</i>",...e(["My cousin's school has ",["18","eighteen"]," classes ",["and","with"]," about ",["800","eight hundred"]," students."]),why:"“My cousin / school” → sở hữu cách <b>My cousin's school</b>; chủ ngữ số ít → <b>has</b>; nối hai ý bằng “and”."},{sec:r,name:"Question 39",pts:t,text:"Write a meaningful sentence based on the cued words:<br><i>You / can / find / dictionary / that / bookshelf.</i>",...e(["You can find ",["the","a"]," dictionary on that bookshelf."]),why:"can + động từ nguyên thể; thêm mạo từ “the/a” trước dictionary và giới từ <b>on</b> (trên giá sách)."},{sec:r,name:"Question 40",pts:t,text:"Write a meaningful sentence based on the cued words:<br><i>One / thing / not like / new neighbourhood / that / it / very / noisy.</i>",...e(["One thing I ",["don't","do not"]," like about my new ",["neighbourhood","neighborhood"]," is that ",["it is","it's"]," very noisy."]),why:"Mẫu câu: <b>One thing I don't like about + N + is that + mệnh đề</b>. Thêm chủ ngữ “I”, “about my”, “is” và “it is”."}]},{id:16204,title:"CK1 · THCS&THPT Bến Hải (Quảng Trị) 2024–2025",time:45,sem:1,book:"i-Learn Smart World",src:"https://tailieu.vn/doc/de-thi-hoc-ki-1-tieng-anh-lop-6-2910722.html",questions:[{sec:C,name:"Câu 11",pts:.5,read:d,text:"Who are Linh's closest friends?",opts:o3("Nga and Mai","Nga and her classmates","Mai and her classmates"),ans:"A",why:"“Of all my friends, Nga and Mai are the ones I spend most of my time with … We are very close friends.”"},{sec:C,name:"Câu 12",pts:.5,read:d,text:"What is Nga's personality like?",opts:o3("Quiet and reserved","Sociable and outgoing","Shy and timid"),ans:"B",why:"“She is sociable”, thích hoạt động ngoài trời, và Linh nói “I am not outgoing as Nga” → Nga hòa đồng, cởi mở. “Quiet and reserved” là Mai."},{sec:C,name:"Câu 13",pts:.5,read:d,text:"What does Mai enjoy doing in her free time?",opts:o3("Playing sports","Going to parties","Studying at the library"),ans:"C",why:"Mai “like(s) the peace and quiet of the school library” → thích học ở thư viện. Chơi thể thao ngoài trời là Nga."},{sec:C,name:"Câu 14",pts:.5,read:d,text:"How does Linh describe her own personality?",opts:o3("Outgoing and talkative","Funny and humorous","Quiet and studious"),ans:"B",why:"“I like telling jokes, and my friends usually like my sense of humour. My jokes make them laugh a lot.” → vui tính, hài hước. Linh nói mình không cởi mở bằng Nga nên A sai."},{sec:C,name:"Câu 15",pts:.5,read:d,text:"What does the passage mainly tell us about?",opts:o3("Linh's school life","Linh's hobbies and interests","Linh's friendship with Nga and Mai"),ans:"C",why:"Cả bài giới thiệu hai bạn thân Nga, Mai, tính cách mỗi người và câu kết “We are very close friends” → nói về tình bạn."},{sec:v,name:"Câu 16",pts:.5,read:p,text:"Choose the word for blank (16).",opts:o3("decorate","buy","break"),ans:"A",why:"clean and <b>decorate</b> their houses = dọn dẹp và trang trí nhà cửa trước Tết."},{sec:v,name:"Câu 17",pts:.5,read:p,text:"Choose the word for blank (17).",opts:o3("in","on","at"),ans:"B",why:"Ngày cụ thể (đêm Giao thừa) dùng <b>on</b>: on New Year's Eve."},{sec:v,name:"Câu 18",pts:.5,read:p,text:"Choose the word for blank (18).",opts:o3("visits","visit","is visiting"),ans:"B",why:"Song song với “they wear …” (hiện tại đơn, chủ ngữ they) → they wear new clothes and <b>visit</b> …"},{sec:v,name:"Câu 19",pts:.5,read:p,text:"Choose the word for blank (19).",opts:o3("because","and","or"),ans:"A",why:"Vế sau giải thích lí do trẻ thích Tết (được lì xì, không phải đi học) → <b>because</b>."},{sec:v,name:"Câu 20",pts:.5,read:p,text:"Choose the word for blank (20).",opts:o3("season","day","time"),ans:"C",why:"a good <b>time</b> for … = dịp tốt để … Tết kéo dài nhiều ngày nên không dùng “day”; Tết không phải một mùa (season)."},{sec:G,name:"Câu 21",pts:.5,text:"Find the underlined item that needs correcting:<br>They <u>lives</u><sup>A</sup> in <u>an</u><sup>B</sup> apartment <u>with</u><sup>C</sup> <u>their</u><sup>D</sup> parents.",opts:o4("lives","an","with","their"),ans:"A",why:"Chủ ngữ “They” số nhiều → động từ không thêm s: sửa <b>lives → live</b>."},{sec:G,name:"Câu 22",pts:.5,text:"Find the underlined item that needs correcting:<br>We are <u>playing</u><sup>A</sup> homework <u>with</u><sup>B</sup> our <u>friends</u><sup>C</sup> at <u>present</u><sup>D</sup>.",opts:o4("playing","with","friends","present"),ans:"A",why:"Cụm đúng là <b>do homework</b> (làm bài tập) → sửa <b>playing → doing</b>."},{sec:R,name:"Câu 23",pts:.5,text:"He likes having sandwiches at his birthday party.<br>→ He wants …………………………",...e(["He wants to have sandwiches at his birthday party."],["He wants to eat sandwiches at his birthday party."]),why:"want + <b>to V</b>: He wants to have sandwiches at his birthday party."},{sec:R,name:"Câu 24",pts:.5,text:"Why don't we go to the movie theater?<br>→ How about …………………………",...e(["How about going to the movie theater?"],["How about going to the movie theatre?"]),why:"Lời rủ: Why don't we + V = How about + <b>V-ing</b>."},{sec:R,name:"Câu 25",pts:.5,text:"He always gets to school on time.<br>→ He is never …………………………",...e(["He is never late for school."],["He is never late to school."]),why:"always on time (luôn đúng giờ) = <b>never late for</b> school (không bao giờ muộn)."},{sec:R,name:"Câu 26",pts:.5,text:"My parents sale clothes at a store.<br>→ My parents are …………………………",...e(["My parents are ",["clothes sellers","sellers","salespeople","sales assistants","shop assistants","salesmen","clothes salespeople"]," at a ",["store.","clothes store."]],["My parents are selling clothes at a store."]),why:"“sale” trong đề là lỗi gõ của “sell” (bán). Bán quần áo ở cửa hàng = là <b>người bán hàng</b>: My parents are clothes sellers / salespeople at a store."},{sec:K,name:"Câu 27",pts:2,type:"write",lines:8,text:"Write an essay (40 – 60 words) to describe your school.<br>You can use the following questions as cues:<br>- What the name of your school is<br>- Where it is<br>- How many students there are<br>- What students often do at your school<br>- You like your school? Why?",model:"<b>Bài mẫu (≈ 60 từ):</b> My school is Hoa Sen Secondary School. It is in the centre of my town, next to a big park. There are about 800 students and 40 teachers. Students often study in big, bright classrooms. At break time, we play football, skip rope or read books in the library. I really like my school because the teachers are kind and my friends are friendly.<br><b>Gợi ý chấm (2 điểm — đề gốc 1 điểm; trường không công bố HD chấm):</b> trả lời đủ các ý gợi ý: 1 · đúng ngữ pháp, chính tả, dùng thì hiện tại đơn: 0,5 · đúng độ dài 40–60 từ, các câu nối mạch lạc: 0,5."}]},{id:16205,title:"CK1 · THCS Long Toàn (TP Hồ Chí Minh) 2025–2026",time:60,sem:1,book:"Global Success",src:"https://thi.tuyensinh247.com/de-thi-ki-1-nam-2025-mon-anh-6-thcs-long-toan-c30a88189.html",questions:[{sec:V,name:"Câu 5",pts:n,text:"Choose the word that has the underlined part pronounced differently from the others.",opts:o4("disl<u>i</u>ke","adv<u>i</u>ce","r<u>i</u>ce","pol<u>i</u>ce"),ans:"D",why:"police /pəˈliːs/ — “i” đọc /iː/; dislike, advice, rice — “i” đọc /aɪ/."},{sec:V,name:"Câu 6",pts:n,text:"Choose the word that has the underlined part pronounced differently from the others.",opts:o4("mother<u>s</u>","centre<u>s</u>","aunt<u>s</u>","cousin<u>s</u>"),ans:"C",why:"aunts — sau âm vô thanh /t/ nên “s” đọc /s/; mothers, centres, cousins — sau âm hữu thanh nên “s” đọc /z/."},{sec:V,name:"Câu 7",pts:n,text:"Choose the word whose main stress is placed differently from the others.",opts:o4("teacher","student","museum","classroom"),ans:"C",why:"museum /mjuˈziːəm/ nhấn âm 2; teacher, student, classroom nhấn âm 1."},{sec:V,name:"Câu 8",pts:n,text:"Choose the word whose main stress is placed differently from the others.",opts:o4("expensive","computer","important","holiday"),ans:"D",why:"holiday /ˈhɒlədeɪ/ nhấn âm 1; expensive, computer, important nhấn âm 2."},{sec:a,name:"Câu 9",pts:n,text:"Look! The girls are ………… rope in the playground.",opts:o4("dancing","playing","skipping","doing"),ans:"C",why:"Nhảy dây là <b>skip rope</b> → are skipping rope."},{sec:a,name:"Câu 10",pts:n,text:"Tet is coming. We ………… clean and decorate our house.",opts:o4("should","shouldn't","mustn't","are"),ans:"A",why:"Sắp Tết thì nên dọn dẹp, trang trí nhà → <b>should</b> + V. “are” không đi với động từ nguyên thể."},{sec:a,name:"Câu 11",pts:n,text:"You ………… speak during the exam - it's forbidden.",opts:o4("should","shouldn't","must","mustn't"),ans:"D",why:"“it's forbidden” (bị cấm) → <b>mustn't</b>. shouldn't chỉ là lời khuyên, nhẹ hơn lệnh cấm."},{sec:a,name:"Câu 12",pts:n,text:"Living in the country is ………… than living in the city.",opts:o4("noisier","more peaceful","peaceful","crowded"),ans:"B",why:"Có “than” → so sánh hơn; nông thôn yên bình hơn thành phố → <b>more peaceful</b>. “noisier” sai nghĩa."},{sec:a,name:"Câu 13",pts:n,text:"When hiking overnight, don't forget to bring the ………… It will keep you warm at night.",opts:o4("sleeping bag","hiking boots","sun cream","painkillers"),ans:"A",why:"Thứ giữ ấm khi ngủ qua đêm là <b>sleeping bag</b> (túi ngủ)."},{sec:a,name:"Câu 14",pts:n,text:"People often clean and decorate their houses ………… Tet.",opts:o4("during","after","before","on"),ans:"C",why:"Dọn dẹp, trang trí nhà là việc làm <b>before</b> Tet (trước Tết)."},{sec:a,name:"Câu 15",pts:n,text:"– <b>Andy:</b> “What would you like to drink now?” – <b>Daisy:</b> “…………”",opts:o4("I'm sorry, I'm late.","Yes, please.","I like to do nothing.","Orange juice, please."),ans:"D",why:"Hỏi muốn uống gì → nêu đồ uống: <b>Orange juice, please.</b> “Yes, please” trả lời câu hỏi Yes/No, không hợp với câu hỏi “What”."},{sec:a,name:"Câu 16",pts:n,text:"Find and circle a mistake:<br>You <u>mustn't</u><sup>A</sup> <u>to go</u><sup>B</sup> <u>out</u><sup>C</sup> alone <u>at</u><sup>D</sup> night.",opts:o4("mustn't","to go","out","at"),ans:"B",why:"Sau động từ khuyết thiếu mustn't dùng động từ nguyên thể KHÔNG “to” → sửa <b>to go → go</b>."},{sec:a,name:"Câu 17",pts:n,text:"Let's ………… helmets when riding on motorbikes.",opts:o4("wears","wore","wearing","wear"),ans:"D",why:"Let's + động từ nguyên thể → <b>wear</b>. (Đề gốc gõ nhầm “hamlets”, đúng là “helmets” — mũ bảo hiểm.)"},{sec:a,name:"Câu 18",pts:n,text:"– <b>David:</b> “Can you tell me the way to Tan Ky House, please?”<br>– <b>Tom:</b> “………… Go straight, then turn right. It's on your right.”",opts:o4("Certainly.","Let's go.","Good idea.","My pleasure."),ans:"A",why:"Đồng ý giúp khi được nhờ chỉ đường: <b>Certainly</b> (Được chứ). “My pleasure” dùng để đáp lời cảm ơn; “Good idea / Let's go” đáp lời rủ."},{sec:a,name:"Câu 19",pts:n,text:"What does this sign mean?",img:I+"e16205-c19.svg",opts:o4("Don't throw rubbish.","Put rubbish in the bin.","No eating.","Clean the street."),ans:"B",why:"Hình người đang bỏ rác vào thùng (không có gạch chéo) → biển nhắc <b>Put rubbish in the bin</b> (bỏ rác vào thùng). Biển cấm mới có vòng tròn gạch chéo."},{sec:a,name:"Câu 20",pts:n,text:"What does this sign mean?",img:I+"e16205-c20.svg",opts:o4("Turn left.","Slow down.","No parking.","Go straight."),ans:"B",why:"Biển tam giác có hình trẻ em là biển cảnh báo có trẻ em qua đường → người lái xe phải <b>Slow down</b> (đi chậm lại)."},{sec:T,name:"Câu 21",pts:n,read:b,text:"Choose the best answer for blank (21).",opts:o4("kitchen","garden","town house","bathroom"),ans:"C",why:"I live in a <b>town house</b> (nhà phố) in Ba Ria Ward — chỉ loại nhà để ở; kitchen, garden, bathroom là một phần của ngôi nhà."},{sec:T,name:"Câu 22",pts:n,read:b,text:"Choose the best answer for blank (22).",opts:o4("tall","large","narrower","beauty"),ans:"B",why:"Cần tính từ đứng trước “living room”, hợp với “Our house is large… a big kitchen” → a <b>large</b> living room. Tall không dùng cho phòng; narrower thiếu “than”; beauty là danh từ."},{sec:T,name:"Câu 23",pts:n,read:b,text:"Choose the best answer for blank (23).",opts:o4("in","with","at","for"),ans:"D",why:"a separate room <b>for</b> our washing machine… = một phòng riêng dành cho máy giặt…"},{sec:T,name:"Câu 24",pts:n,read:b,text:"Choose the best answer for blank (24).",opts:o4("have","has","having","to have"),ans:"A",why:"Song song với “we often sit and …” (chủ ngữ we, hiện tại đơn) → <b>have</b> afternoon tea."},{sec:T,name:"Câu 25",pts:n,read:b,text:"Choose the best answer for blank (25).",opts:o4("a little","very","a few","many"),ans:"B",why:"Trước tính từ “convenient” dùng trạng từ <b>very</b> (rất). A little / a few / many đi với danh từ."},{sec:x,name:"Câu 26",pts:n,read:g,text:"Tet is the biggest festival in Vietnam.",opts:u,ans:"A",why:"True. Bài viết: “Tet is the most important festival in Vietnam” — lễ quan trọng nhất, lớn nhất trong năm."},{sec:x,name:"Câu 27",pts:n,read:g,text:"Tet always happens in March.",opts:u,ans:"B",why:"False. “It usually takes place in late January or early February.”"},{sec:x,name:"Câu 28",pts:n,read:g,text:"People clean and decorate their houses before Tet.",opts:u,ans:"A",why:"True. “Before Tet, people clean their houses and decorate them with colorful flowers.”"},{sec:x,name:"Câu 29",pts:n,read:g,text:"Children receive lucky money during Tet.",opts:u,ans:"A",why:"True. Ngày đầu Tết các gia đình “give lucky money to children”."},{sec:x,name:"Câu 30",pts:n,read:g,text:"People stay at home and do not visit anyone at Tet.",opts:u,ans:"B",why:"False. “People visit their relatives and friends to wish them a happy and healthy new year.”"},{sec:j,name:"Câu 31",pts:n,text:"Banh Chung is made of ………… rice, pork and green bean. (stick)",...e(["sticky"]),why:"Trước danh từ “rice” cần tính từ: stick → <b>sticky</b> rice (gạo nếp)."},{sec:j,name:"Câu 32",pts:n,text:"You should keep ………… by eating well and exercising regularly. (health)",...e(["healthy"]),why:"keep + tính từ (giữ cho …): keep <b>healthy</b> (khỏe mạnh)."},{sec:j,name:"Câu 33",pts:n,text:"Everybody around is cheering and singing …………. (happy)",...e(["happily"]),why:"Bổ nghĩa cho động từ (cheering and singing) cần trạng từ: happy → <b>happily</b>."},{sec:j,name:"Câu 34",pts:n,text:"I will help my father with the house …………. (decorate)",...e(["decoration"],["decorations"],["decorating"]),why:"Sau “the house” cần danh từ (help somebody with + N): decorate → <b>decoration</b> (việc trang trí nhà)."},{sec:E,name:"Câu 35",pts:L,text:"Daisy has four books in her bag. <i>(Viết lại câu với từ gợi ý mà nghĩa không thay đổi)</i><br>→ There …………………………",...e(["There are ",["four","4"]," books in her bag."],["There are ",["four","4"]," books in Daisy's bag."]),why:"“has … in” = “There are + danh từ số nhiều + in …”: There are four books in her bag."},{sec:E,name:"Câu 36",pts:L,text:"The black dress is cheaper than the white one. <i>(Viết lại câu với từ gợi ý nghĩa không thay đổi)</i><br>→ The white dress …………………………",...e(["The white dress is more expensive than the black ",["one.","dress."]]),why:"Đảo hai vế thì đổi tính từ sang nghĩa ngược: cheaper ↔ <b>more expensive</b> (expensive là tính từ dài)."},{sec:E,name:"Câu 37",pts:L,text:"mustn't / We / throw / trash / the / on / streets. <i>(Sắp xếp các từ thành câu có nghĩa)</i>",...e(["We mustn't throw trash on the streets."],["We must not throw trash on the streets."]),why:"Chủ ngữ “We” + mustn't + V nguyên thể (throw) + trash + on the streets."}]})})();
